[333.059182, "o", "214\t## Investigation Brief 02 — Status Precedence\r\n222\t## Investigation Brief 02 — Status Precedence — supporting chronology\r\n384\t## Investigation Brief 03 — Compliance Mail Timing\r\n393\t## Investigation Brief 03 — Compliance Mail Timing — supporting chronology\r\n555\t## Investigation Brief 04 — Correction Notice Precedence\r\n564\t## Investigation Brief 04 — Correction Notice Precedence — supporting chronology\r\n672\t## Investigation Brief 05 — Meeting Amendments and Owners\r\n680\t## Investigation Brief 05 — Meeting Amendments and Owners — supporting chronology\r\n856\t## Investigation Brief 06 — Effective Dates on Output\r\n865\t## Investigation Brief 06 — Effective Dates on Output — supporting chronology\r\n973\t## Investigation Brief 07 — Exception Flags (Part I)\r\n983\t## Investigation Brief 07 — Exception Flags (Part I) — supporting chronology\r\n1145\t## Investigation Brief 08 — Exception Flags (Part II)\r\n1153\t## Investigation Brief 08 — Exception Flags (Part II) — supporting chronolo"]
